  'advanced.dump_help': ["Folder with PokedexData.zip (and optionally PokemmoIconsDump.zip, PokemmoBattleSpritesDump.zip, ItemSpriteDump.zip), or a combined Pokemmo-Dumps archive.","Carpeta con PokedexData.zip (y opcionalmente PokemmoIconsDump.zip, PokemmoBattleSpritesDump.zip e ItemSpriteDump.zip), o un archivo combinado Pokemmo-Dumps.","包含 PokedexData.zip 的文件夹（可选包含 PokemmoIconsDump.zip、PokemmoBattleSpritesDump.zip、ItemSpriteDump.zip），或合并的 Pokemmo-Dumps 压缩包。"],
  'advanced.personal_guides': ["Your own walkthrough files (optional)","Tus propios archivos de guía (opcional)","个人攻略文件（可选）"],
  'advanced.personal_guides_help': ["The five regional walkthroughs are already built in (Guides › Storyline). Import your own .odt copies only to use a different version; your checkmarks stay with each character run.","Las cinco guías regionales ya están integradas (Guías › Historia). Importa tus propios .odt solo si quieres usar otra versión; las marcas se conservan para cada partida de personaje.","已内置五个地区的攻略（攻略 › 剧情）。仅在需要使用其他版本时导入自己的 .odt 文件；每个角色流程的完成标记都会保留。"],
  'advanced.imported_guide': ["{region}: {name} · {steps} steps · imported {date}","{region}: {name} · {steps} pasos · importado {date}","{region}：{name} · {steps} 步 · 导入于 {date}"],
  'advanced.no_imported_guides': ["None imported. Guides use the bundled milestone outline.","No se ha importado ninguna. Las guías usan el esquema de hitos integrado.","未导入个人攻略。攻略使用内置里程碑概要。"],
  'advanced.guide_format': ["Reads “KANTO COMPLETE WALKTHROUGH.odt” etc. Re-importing keeps your checkmarks (stable step IDs) and flags any step whose wording changed.","Lee «KANTO COMPLETE WALKTHROUGH.odt», etc. Volver a importar conserva las marcas (IDs de pasos estables) y señala los pasos cuyo texto cambió.","读取“KANTO COMPLETE WALKTHROUGH.odt”等文件。重新导入会保留完成标记（稳定的步骤 ID），并标记文字发生变化的步骤。"],
