  'system.startup': ["Startup & game integration","Inicio e integración con el juego","启动与游戏集成"],
  'system.startup_help': ["Everything here is optional and can be switched off again. Companion never changes, closes or reads PokeMMO.","Todo es opcional y se puede desactivar. Companion nunca modifica, cierra ni lee PokeMMO.","此处所有功能均为可选，可随时关闭。Companion 不会修改、关闭或读取 PokeMMO。"],
  'system.auto_open': ["Open Companion automatically when you start PokeMMO","Abrir Companion automáticamente al iniciar PokeMMO","启动 PokeMMO 时自动打开 Companion"],
  'system.auto_open_intro': ["Start PokeMMO the way you always do (shortcut, menu, Steam-less launcher) and Companion opens with it. ","Inicia PokeMMO como siempre (acceso directo, menú o lanzador sin Steam) y Companion se abrirá con él. ","照常启动 PokeMMO（快捷方式、菜单或非 Steam 启动程序），Companion 会一同打开。"],
  'system.auto_open_helper': ["This uses a tiny helper that starts with your login and only watches for the PokeMMO process — it never reads, changes or closes the game. ","Se usa un pequeño proceso auxiliar que se inicia con tu sesión y solo detecta el proceso de PokeMMO; nunca lee, modifica ni cierra el juego. ","此功能使用登录时启动的小型辅助程序，仅检测 PokeMMO 进程，不会读取、修改或关闭游戏。"],
  'system.auto_open_restart': ["The helper has to be running: after turning this on, log out and in once (or restart). Turn it off here at any time.","El proceso auxiliar debe estar activo: tras habilitarlo, cierra y vuelve a iniciar sesión (o reinicia). Puedes desactivarlo aquí cuando quieras.","辅助程序必须运行：开启后请注销并重新登录一次（或重启）。随时可在此关闭。"],
  'system.launcher_missing': ["Not found automatically. Choose PokeMMO.exe or PokeMMO.sh — or the Flatpak is used when installed.","No se detectó automáticamente. Elige PokeMMO.exe o PokeMMO.sh; se usa Flatpak si está instalado.","未自动找到。请选择 PokeMMO.exe 或 PokeMMO.sh；若安装了 Flatpak 版本，则使用该版本。"],
